    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 49 St Brendan's Park, an impressive three-bedroom semi-detached home ideally positioned within this mature and well-established residential development in Coolock, Dublin 5.\n\nThe property, which would benefit from some general modernisation, offers generously proportioned accommodation throughout and enjoys the added benefit of an adjoining garage to the side, providing valuable additional storage and excellent versatility. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living room, family room, kitchen/dining room and downstairs bathroom. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom. The garage to the side completes the spacious 107 m2 area. Externally, there is driveway parking to the front and a sizable south westerly facing rear garden (not directly overlooked), ideal for late evening sun summer evenings. \n\nSt Brendan's Park is a well-established and popular residential location, conveniently situated close to a host of local amenities including shops, schools, sports and recreational facilities. The area is well served by public transport, while Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the M50 motorway are all within easy reach.\n\n49 St Brendan's Park represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom semi-detached home in a mature and convenient North Dublin location, with well-proportioned accommodation and the added benefit of a substantial side garage. Ideal for first time buyers, owner occupying families or investors.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and location this property has to offer.."
      },
